      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `05069e23b780a3618e64da2c2fd868980e10bc090e129e658ba3ae901644acb6--DungogLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 1195d5d1f1bfe404b30873f7b22d673bef581fe12250fca73b39842ef2972c9d | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 73f57603b12839d2d1ded606c0ec5b9a89fce566cc7e5e9d931946a784c88c77 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 555300596d4a02877374e14aee55cbe0631d37a19139409db6268f3ddc9dc4ca | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 790e00b92a18559d8050049b5ad09c04777c9c8323538c7353fbc5d3add11d94 | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | ef54ff33166e6492d8cf201ea9c07f9c0c2017a4a1362cfcbbc072f601e94326 | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 1b302104656643b940a934a67cc4d4d3bdc65816c475b87fcdfcb06fa372af85 | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 99d7f6d2cf809bc7676664fdc1188d8903f60ab580c7111eff9f6f19d1a910d5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
